Before installing OpenWrt **snapshot** versions, please take a look at the bug report system here [[https://bugs.openwrt.org/?string=archerc20i]] & [[git>c20i|latest git commits for C20i]] to rule out any reported bugs. Also keep in mind there is no LuCi/Web GUI included in snapshot images, but can be installed by following this infomation [[docs:guide-quick-start:developmentinstallation#optional_next_steps]].

